This repository holds the source code of the FOMO Alerts Chrome extension (extension/) and verify.js. It is public
so that anyone can check what the extension does. You may read it, and run verify.js to check that the extension in
the Chrome Web Store is this code. You may not copy, change, publish, share, sell or reuse this code or any part of
it, or use it to make another product, without written permission from FOMO Alerts. (GitHub's own terms let people
view and fork public repositories on GitHub; that gives no permission to use the code anywhere else.)

